<li class="brz-fs-lg-22 brz-ft-google brz-ff-overpass brz-tp-lg-empty brz-fsft-lg-0 brz-fwdth-lg-100 brz-vfw-lg-400 brz-lh-lg-1 brz-ls-lg-0 brz-fw-lg-700 brz-fss-lg-px brz-mb-lg-12 brz-css-wdaCz" data-generated-css="brz-css-fNIEC" data-uniq-id="paIha">2 x 500g Local Honey from Rusty Gate</li>
